{"componentChunkName":"component---src-layouts-blog-post-js","path":"/blog/mans-back","result":{"data":{"post":{"title":"Man's back","caption":"I survived America 🇺🇸","featuredImage":{"title":"UK","description":"","fluid":{"base64":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","aspectRatio":1.5,"src":"//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/sdpoLhfGp7ByC2yIXBtYs/87146d0a39250150901c1bc3ab117e3e/uk.jpg?w=3000&q=50","srcSet":"//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/sdpoLhfGp7ByC2yIXBtYs/87146d0a39250150901c1bc3ab117e3e/uk.jpg?w=750&h=500&q=50 750w,\n//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/sdpoLhfGp7ByC2yIXBtYs/87146d0a39250150901c1bc3ab117e3e/uk.jpg?w=1500&h=1000&q=50 1500w,\n//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/sdpoLhfGp7ByC2yIXBtYs/87146d0a39250150901c1bc3ab117e3e/uk.jpg?w=3000&h=2000&q=50 3000w","srcWebp":"//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/sdpoLhfGp7ByC2yIXBtYs/87146d0a39250150901c1bc3ab117e3e/uk.jpg?w=3000&q=50&fm=webp","srcSetWebp":"//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/sdpoLhfGp7ByC2yIXBtYs/87146d0a39250150901c1bc3ab117e3e/uk.jpg?w=750&h=500&q=50&fm=webp 750w,\n//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/sdpoLhfGp7ByC2yIXBtYs/87146d0a39250150901c1bc3ab117e3e/uk.jpg?w=1500&h=1000&q=50&fm=webp 1500w,\n//images.ctfassets.net/l62l9fcffwik/sdpoLhfGp7ByC2yIXBtYs/87146d0a39250150901c1bc3ab117e3e/uk.jpg?w=3000&h=2000&q=50&fm=webp 3000w","sizes":"(max-width: 3000px) 100vw, 3000px"}},"date":"2019-09-13","id":"11d8215a-63b3-508e-a44b-06060f46001b","content":{"json":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Feeling pretty emotional right now for a number of reasons so apologies in advance if this gets a bit gooey.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"I’m currently sitting on a plane on my way back to London trying to figure out what or how I should be feeling. But am I sad about leaving America?","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Having lived there for a year, I do now feel a sense of loyalty to San Francisco, a place I’m happy to call a third home 🏠 (after Rainham and Leamington Spa). I can’t really say that I’m feeling sad about leaving the city necessarily, more just not being able to see some people I have every day for the past year. I have so many plans and things that I’m looking forward to back home, I don’t feel that I’m going to be missing out on something San Francisco offered, that London can’t. Don’t get me wrong I’m not hating on San Francisco, I love the place and would highly recommend it to anyone who wanted to visit a city in America or even live there, especially for anyone with a tech or entrepreneurial background 😎.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"It’s been quite the year, interesting to say the least full of its ups and downs. There was a period close to the beginning where I felt the lowest I ever have, extremely close to calling its quits and coming back home, only stopped by pure stubbornness. And then there have been times in the last few months which have been the polar opposite and among some of the best feelings I’ve had being able to experience some really cool stuff, like jet skiing in Lake Tahoe 🏞.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"As I mentioned, I’ve got a load of things to look forward to. I’m continuing to work for the startup I’ve been at for the last year but now remotely on a part time basis which is ideal for me. I plan to spend the rest of the time working on some cool projects including one of which I’m super excited about and you should hopefully hear about soon! 🎙👬👀","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"So this post hasn’t really been much of a review of my year, just more of some feelings I have on my mind as I’m flying back that I just wanted to write down. It’s felt good. Hopefully I’ll have another post up soon with some advice on being in the US (particularly San Francisco) compared to the UK (particularly London), although I’ve been working on that for months now so who knows😬.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Ta léme,","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Aaron","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"fields":{"readingTime":{"text":"3 min read"}}}},"signatureLight":{"childImageSharp":{"fluid":{"base64":"data:image/png;base64,","aspectRatio":0.9345794392523364,"src":"/static/a56bb448c38ea4d2f901a14c780c899a/169d0/signature-light.png","srcSet":"/static/a56bb448c38ea4d2f901a14c780c899a/69585/signature-light.png 200w,\n/static/a56bb448c38ea4d2f901a14c780c899a/169d0/signature-light.png 259w","sizes":"(max-width: 259px) 100vw, 259px"}}},"signatureDark":{"childImageSharp":{"fluid":{"base64":"data:image/png;base64,","aspectRatio":0.9345794392523364,"src":"/static/a6a6e226b6a5f5dee489972d46f53256/169d0/signature-dark.png","srcSet":"/static/a6a6e226b6a5f5dee489972d46f53256/69585/signature-dark.png 200w,\n/static/a6a6e226b6a5f5dee489972d46f53256/169d0/signature-dark.png 259w","sizes":"(max-width: 259px) 100vw, 259px"}}},"avatar":{"childImageSharp":{"fluid":{"base64":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","aspectRatio":1,"src":"/static/ae9d5416402310a01aa837eaae5d9691/49b36/avatar.jpg","srcSet":"/static/ae9d5416402310a01aa837eaae5d9691/f836f/avatar.jpg 200w,\n/static/ae9d5416402310a01aa837eaae5d9691/2244e/avatar.jpg 400w,\n/static/ae9d5416402310a01aa837eaae5d9691/49b36/avatar.jpg 512w","sizes":"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px"}}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"mans-back"}},"staticQueryHashes":["3574470190","3574470190"]}